格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The skills for trading, to make your agent earn for you.","id":"gh:1148224636","install_available":false,"language":"Shell","name":"minara-skills","slug":"Minara-AI/minara-skills","topics":["agent-skills","codex","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The skills for trading, to make your agent earn for you."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Minara Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Minara is an AI-native financial OS, and these skills bring it into your agent. Trade US and Korean "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"stocks, futures, indices, commodities, forex, and crypto in plain language. Run on-chain transaction"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"s, manage wallets, and get real-time market data across EVM, Solana, and Hyperliquid."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **⚡ Strategy Studio** — go beyond execution: AI-powered backtesting and AI factor-combination stra"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"tegies. Available now on the web at **strategy.minara.ai**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"### Works with"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Spot Trading** — Buy, sell, swap, convert, and transfer by ticker, token name, or contract addre"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ss across supported chains.\n- **Perpetual Futures** — Open/close positions, leverage, multi-wallet m"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"anagement, trade history, and AI autopilot on Hyperliquid.\n- **Limit Orders** — Create, list, and ca"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ncel spot and perps limit orders.\n- **Wallet & Funds** — Built-in wallet, balance, portfolio, deposi"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"t addresses, spot/perps funding, withdrawals, transfers, and credit card on-ramp via MoonPay.\n- **AI"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" Insights & Market** — Real-time on-chain data, token fundamentals, whale flows, trending tokens/sto"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"cks, equity research, commodities, and forex.\n- **x402 Payment** — Pay x402-enabled HTTP APIs direct"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"ly from the Minara wallet.\n- **Premium** — Plans, credits, and subscription management."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Supported Networks"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, Avalanche, Solana, BSC, Berachain, Blast, Manta, Mode, "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"Sonic, Conflux, Merlin, Monad, Polymarket, XLayer, and Hyperliquid (perps)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Claude Code"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**One-click (recommended):** Send this prompt to your Claude Code agent:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"This installs the Minara CLI, copies skill files to `~/.claude/skills/minara` and starts the login f"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" installs the Minara CLI, copies skill files to `~/.claude/skills/minara` and starts the login flow."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Manual:**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"OpenClaw\n**One-click (recommended):** Send this prompt to your OpenClaw agent:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"This installs the CLI, copies skill files to `~/.openclaw/skills/minara`, registers the skill in `op"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"enclaw.json`, starts login."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**ClawHub:**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Manual:**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Add to `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Hermes"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**One-click (recommended):** Send this prompt to your Hermes agent:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"This installs the Minara CLI, copies skill files to `~/.hermes/skills/minara` and starts the login f"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" installs the Minara CLI, copies skill files to `~/.hermes/skills/minara` and starts the login flow."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**Manual:**"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Talk to the agent in natural language. It runs the right commands for you."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Basic flow"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Step        | Example prompts                                                                     "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"   | Example prompts                                                                               |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| **Login**   | _\"Login to Minara\"_                                                                 "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"          |\n| **Deposit** | _\"Show my deposit address\"_ / _\"Buy crypto with credit card\"_ / _\"Deposi"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"t 500 USDC to perps\"_ |\n| **Trade**   | _\"Buy 100 USDC worth of ETH\"_ / _\"Swap 0.1 ETH to USDC\"_ / _"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"\"Sell all SOL\"_                   |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### Perps and limit orders"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Goal              | Example prompts                                         |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| **Open position** | _\"Long ETH perp\"_ / _\"Short BTC, 10x leverage\"_         |\n| **AI analysis**   "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"| _\"Analyze ETH long or short\"_ / _\"Should I long BTC?\"_  |\n| **Autopilot**     | _\"Enable AI autopi"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"lot for perps\"_                       |\n| **Limit order**   | _\"Buy ETH when price hits $3000\"_ / _\""},{"id":"p41s4","text":"Buy SOL at $150\"_ |\n| **Manage orders** | _\"List my limit orders\"_ / _\"Cancel limit order [id]\"_  |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### More examples"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- _\"Show my crypto portfolio\"_ / _\"What's my balance?\"_\n- _\"What tokens are trending?\"_ / _\"Search f"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"or SOL tokens\"_\n- _\"Pay 100 USDC to [address]\"_ / _\"Withdraw 10 SOL to [address]\"_"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"See examples.md for full CLI examples."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Benchmark"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"**88/100** on crypto-skill-bench (v3.0.2, Claude Sonnet 4.6, 76 scenarios)"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"| Dimension | Score |"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| Safety | 91 |\n| Coverage | 86 |\n| Robustness | 88 |\n| Routing | 88 |\n| UX | 86 |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"66 passed, 10 partial, 0 failed. Safety gate: PASS."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Scripts"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"| Script                                       | Purpose                                            "},{"id":"p51s2","text":"                                                    |"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"| `scripts/claudecode-minara-skill-setup.sh`   | One-click installer for Claude Code: installs CLI, "},{"id":"p52s2","text":"copies skill, runs login                            |\n| `scripts/openclaw-minara-skill-setup.sh`    "},{"id":"p52s3","text":" | One-click installer for OpenClaw: installs CLI, copies skill, registers in `openclaw.json`, runs "},{"id":"p52s4","text":"login |\n| `scripts/hermes-minara-skill-setup.sh`       | One-click installer for Hermes: installs CL"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"I, copies skill, runs login                                |\n| `skills/minara/scripts/version-check."},{"id":"p52s6","text":"sh`     | Session-level version detector — outputs `UP_TO_DATE`, `SNOOZED`, or `UPGRADE cli:X→Y [ski"},{"id":"p52s7","text":"ll:X→Y]`     |\n| `scripts/gen-star-history.py`                | Regenerates `assets/star-history.svg"},{"id":"p52s8","text":"` from live stargazer data (needs `gh` authed). Run, then commit.  |"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"All setup scripts are idempotent and support the same three-tier skill download fallback: ClawHub → "},{"id":"p53s2","text":"GitHub → clawhub CLI."},{"id":"p54s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"This repo contains documentation files and setup scripts. No binaries or long-running services. The "},{"id":"p55s2","text":"setup scripts install the Minara CLI from npm and copy skill files into the skills directory. Creden"},{"id":"p55s3","text":"tials are handled by the CLI's official login flow; this repo does not collect or store secrets."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"- Discord\n- Minara\n- Minara CLI (npm)\n- Crypto Skill Benchmark\n- OpenClaw Skills\n- ClawHub"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
